[I] Tiny date, time diff calculator with piggybacked timers

[T] pdd (Python3 Date Diff) is a tiny command line utility to calculate date
[T] and time differences. It can also be used as a countdown or stopwatch
[T] timer and shows the current date, time and calendar when run without
[T] arguments.

[U] https://github.com/jarun/pdd

[A] Pdd Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

